the lemma with $a=1/2$ then gives the inequality for every $G$ satisfying $\|G\|_{HS}\ge  1$.
 \end{proof}

\begin{remark}
If the process is known to be stationary, we can use the unbiased estimators for both the covariance, $\UECorrtau{Y}$, and the cross-covariance, $\UECorrtau{Z}$, respectively
\end{remark}
\begin{remark}
We can easily adapt the above results for non-stationary processes by simply modifying the definition of risk.
\end{remark}
