&\leq \delta /2{+}\delta /2{+}2\left( m-1\right) \beta_{\mu}\left(\tau\right),
\end{align*}% 
where the second inequality follows from Prop. \ref{prop:con_ineq_ps}. Substitution of the expressions for $F\left( \mathbf{Y}%
\right) $ and $F^{\prime }\left( \mathbf{Y}\right) $ and using $\delta = 2\delta'$, we obtain%
