After learning the dynamics with the PEM-UDE approach and recovering the symbolic form of the UDE expressions via STLSQ, the new NGNMM with correction factors for sparsity is given by the parameter values in Table \ref{tab:ccfit} and by the functional form:

\begin{subequations}
\begin{align} \label{eq:ccsymb}
    \dot{r} &= \frac{\Delta}{\pi} + 2rv - (\alpha + g_\text{syn}s)r + f_1(\harpoon{u}, p_c)\\ 
    \dot{v} &= v(v-\alpha) - w + \bar{\eta} + I_\text{ext} + g_\text{syn}s(e_r-v)-(\pi r)^2 + f_2(\harpoon{u}, p_c)\\
    \dot{w} &= a(bv-w) + w_\text{jump}r\\
    \dot{s} &= -\frac{s}{\tau_s} + s_\text{jump}r\\
    f_1(\harpoon{u}, p_c) &= \phi_1s + \phi_2p_c + \phi_3vp_c + c_1 \\
    f_2(\harpoon{u}, p_c) &= \phi_4r + \phi_5w^2 + c_2
\end{align}
\end{subequations}

