Each dancer's current facing is denoted by a full circle (forward-facing dancer) or a half circle (backward-facing dancer) with different colors distinguishing each dancer. 
For the paths traversed by the dancers, a solid line denotes the path traversed by a forward-facing dancer, and a dotted line denotes a backward-facing dancer's path. 



