    3x_1 & \;   & +\; x_3 & =\; 0, \\
    2x_1 & -\; x_2 & \;   & =\; 0.
    \end{array}
    \right.
\end{equation}
Solving the above system, we obtain
\begin{align}  \label{part_2}
