       & \qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\quad - 6\{Q_n^{1, 1}, Q_n^{2, 0} - Q_n^{0, 2}\} + 6Q^{2, 0}Q_n^{2, 0} - 6Q^{0, 2}Q_n^{0, 2} + \cdots. 
