The remainder of this manuscript is structured as follows. The next section presents a review of related literature. \Cref{sec:model} formalizes the mode and defines omniscient and greedy policies. \Cref{sec:procedure} describes  our procedure to identify the greedy policy $\alg$.  \Cref{sec:results} presents our main theoretical results. \Cref{sec:numerical} uses numerical simulations to test the performance of $\alg$ in settings without homogeneous departures. \Cref{sec:discussion} concludes by discussing future work and associated conjectures.

