        & = \frac{\sum_{k=1}^\infty k \left(\frac{\lambda}{\mu } \right)^k \frac{1}{k!}}{\sum_{k=1}^\infty  \left(\frac{\lambda}{\mu } \right)^k \frac{1}{k!}}\\
        &= \frac{ \frac{\lambda}{\mu }}{1-e^{-\frac{\lambda}{\mu }}} \\
