With this, we aimed to select the best generalized model among the trained GNNs, which is an important aspect to develop symbolic models with similar structure. 
The exact numerical $R^2$ values for the selected GNN model can be found in Tab.~\ref{tab:R2values}.
To further investigate the effects of varying $\mathrm{Re_p}$ and $\VF$ on the GNN performance, we analyze the correlation plots obtained by this selected model. 

