\subsection{Investigating the Effect of Offshore Winds}

\subsubsection{Prevalence of Negative Wind Speed Gradients Across Campaign Phases}

Negative wind speed gradients occurred in 19.8\% of observations across the combined dataset, though this rate varied across different phases of the campaign. Figure~\ref{fig:neg_gradient} presents the frequency of negative wind speed gradients stratified by study phase, revealing significant variation across phases.

