\subsection{Utilizing Shannon Entropy}
While raw Likert values for each trait were assessed over time and plotted (Figure~\ref{fig:likert_distributions}), the primary investigatory mechanism for the set of ODEs utilized by this framework was a multidimensional compression of responses into a single, Shannon entropy-based metric (Figure~\ref{fig:entropy_trends})
for each trait and year, with the Shannon entropy over the categorical response distributions per item set (non-normalized below and later normalized for ODE analysis).

